+        "RB9: a first settle after a received LeaveAll owes nothing: the next "
+        "tx! sends New Ready and no Empty (%zu pushes, code %d)",
+        h.l_push.size(), h.l_push.empty() ? -1 : h.l_push[0].code);
+}
 
